 precipitation shows no clear long-term change (+0.15 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 11.8 inches a year. The wettest year was 1983 (20.33 in); the driest, 1966 (5.34 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":false,"hi":true},"t_year":"2026 so far: 19 daily record highs, 3 daily record lows"}}